# Root Docker build context rules.
#
# The VALIDATOR image is built with the context at this repo ROOT
#   (docker build -f deploy/validator/Dockerfile -t <ecr>/vg-validator:pinned-<sha> .)
# so this file decides what that context may contain. It must NOT contain
# forensic-wm/ (CONTRACT.md section 0): the validator is a small ffprobe +
# ClamAV image and must never carry the generator's research tree, samples
# or outputs.
#
# The GENERATOR image is built with the context at forensic-wm/
#   (docker build --platform linux/amd64 -f forensic-wm/deploy/generator/Dockerfile
#    -t <ecr>/forensic-wm-generator:hevc-v1-<sha> forensic-wm)
# which has its OWN .dockerignore allowlist (forensic-wm/.dockerignore), so
# this root file does NOT affect that build at all.
#
# Deliberately NOT excluded: deploy/, src/, tests/, infra/, edge/, .github/
# (harmless as context inputs and useful for cache/pin provenance).

forensic-wm/
.git/
**/__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
**/*.pyc
node_modules/
outputs/
*.tfstate*
.terraform/
